#: src/lib/generated-docs-from-md-files/isomorphic-lib-v21/docs/taon-admin/seo.component.html:23
msgid "The SEO provider loads the global settings and matching page override after Angular starts and on primary route changes. It updates title, description, keywords, canonical URL, robots, and Open Graph metadata. Query strings, fragments, matrix parameters, and auxiliary outlets do not select a page override; trailing slashes are normalized."
